            <ArticleTitle>Spin-chemistry concepts for spintronics scientists.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1427-1445</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3762/bjnano.8.143</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Spin chemistry and spintronics developed independently and with different terminology. Until now, the interaction between the two fields has been very limited. In this review, we compile the two &quot;languages&quot; in an effort to enhance communication. We expect that knowledge of spin chemistry will accelerate progress in spintronics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
